# Project Always Rules

## Never commit
- `.env` / `.env.local` — secrets
- `agent-context/` (gitignored)

## Branch naming
`feat/[ticket-id]` · `fix/[ticket-id]` · `chore/[description]`

## i18n
Every user-visible string uses i18next. No hardcoded English/Hindi in JSX.

## Theme
Use `src/utils/theme.ts` / `baseline.md`. No random hex in new UI.

## State
Zustand in `src/store/`. Prefer existing store fields before new stores.

## Tests
Jest tests must be deterministic — mock network/Firebase.

## PR size
Prefer PRs under ~400 lines changed.
